{"formal_ids": ["GS-372"], "labels": ["多元函数偏导", "多元函数微分学", "多元函数极限", "多元函数连续可微", "极限与连续"], "metadata": {"capture_ids": ["MFI-CAP-ee3c539cae49877df3011735"], "closeout_id": "MFI-CLOSE-1b2d345b69db8327ebd0b627", "conversation_complete": true, "coverage": "full_bytes", "files": [{"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-09-09/MATHPKG-6a1bd1d72750ba00e2edffdb/conversation.json", "sha256": "1b6f303c1576d3e284d43d4edad96244e9885f79958a2473308dc1eabfa5a037", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-09-09/MATHPKG-6a1bd1d72750ba00e2edffdb/source.json", "sha256": "8eed4ccb0b4064b48c468d1ab6b85b4230cabb326e1e020e6d0fd7b45b43db98", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-09/MATHPKG-6a1bd1d72750ba00e2edffdb/attachments/question_image_01.png", "sha256": "78b39e1edeabf0d215a79517c105de9da1ad6d48d74f7c5e24c4affa0724ceb7", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-09/MATHPKG-6a1bd1d72750ba00e2edffdb/attachments/solution_text_01.txt", "sha256": "a0473e62f251b4c50b9d140117bb64ea7ccc9a6fd0cb75f7f6870c3dfbb6b58b", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-09/MATHPKG-6a1bd1d72750ba00e2edffdb", "original_sha256": "5e2d932acd4effda298d8caa60c64e37e6d3c7daaec97bea7ec1311cc375fe00", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-29ccb654a53a84754e5a5352", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["recurrence_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/a27be3b375ddcec6d33803138933b3aaab12bcb4f4ca00f4fecfa7a12ad37e5d.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "a27be3b375ddcec6d33803138933b3aaab12bcb4f4ca00f4fecfa7a12ad37e5d", "user_turn_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 452], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "f5a8dcd9444a27085c3c1bb7aa24ef5907541b502a16558da6c48617db10f197", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 243], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6ef3b9f19d6fc392b33d543e4380f8a46388ecd478fb3037735772fcc85f18de", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 66], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "e1ca33817cf7b018af01424bdbaa46180f6a2f1b41b2a2bfada46aa77cf64229", "role": "user", "sequence": 10}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题首先肯定连续，对吧？\n\n已知 g(0, 0) = 0。看它是否连续，就是看 lim (x→0, y→0) g(x, y) 是否等于 0：\n令 y = x，此时变为 √(2x²) = √2 · |x|。当 x→0 时，整体趋于 0，所以 lim (x→0, y→0) g(x, y) = 0，刚好连续，先把 C、D 排除，在 A、B 之间选。\n\n关于偏导数是否存在：\n看 g 对 x 在 (0, 0) 点处的偏导，它应该等于 x² / √(x² + y²)。因为分子是 x²，分母是 √(x² + y²)，分子次数比分母高，所以趋于 0。对 y 的偏导也同理，因此在 (0, 0) 处的偏导数都等于 0。\n\n再看可微性（或者偏导连续性）：\n看 [g(x, y) - g(0, 0) - g\\_x(0, 0)x - g\\_y(0, 0)y] / √(x² + y²)，代入后变成 √(x² + y²) / √(x² + y²) = 1，极限不为 0。\n\n所以它是不存在（不可微）的，应该选 B，对吧？\n"}